        {
          "text": "China asset-backed private credit,",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "since 2004.",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "ShoreVest provides asset-backed credit solutions to borrowers and financial institutions across China.",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "Underwriting discipline",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "For a secured credit investor, the relevant question is not whether every part of the property market is healthy. It is whether a specific asset can generate cash, attract users and transact at a price that leaves the lender with a meaningful margin of safety.",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "Collateral value and margin of safety",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "Entry terms are assessed against downside cases and expected recovery value. Higher cap rates and recent transaction evidence should be reflected in collateral values.",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "Legal and structural position",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "Claim priority, documentation and enforceability are reviewed for each situation.",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "Exit and recovery routes",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "Potential repayment, restructuring and resolution routes are considered before capital is committed.",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "Risk management and downside analysis are applied across investments, at both the transaction and portfolio level.",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "China Debt Dynamics",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "Selected research · September 2026 · Volume 10, Issue 3",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "Perceptions Versus Reality in China Real Estate",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "Shanghai or Ghost Town? A tale of two markets, and why the distinction matters for asset-backed credit.",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "China's residential development downturn is real. But it does not follow that every completed commercial property is empty, untradeable, or unsuitable as collateral. The data increasingly points to a more segmented reality: severe stress in new residential development alongside improving liquidity and stabilization in selected completed, income-producing commercial assets.",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "Read the selected issue",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "China Debt Dynamics archive",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "This letter expresses the views of the author as of the date indicated and such views are subject to change without notice.",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "Strategy scope",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "Asset-backed lending",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "Asset-backed financing for companies with identifiable collateral and financing needs, including bridge, refinancing and acquisition situations.",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "Asset restructuring",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "Capital for situations involving viable assets and challenged balance sheets, including restructurings and deep value acquisitions.",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "Debt resolution",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "Credit solutions for financial institutions and other claim holders seeking to transfer, restructure or resolve distressed credit, including non-performing loans.",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "Explore our strategy",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "People and execution",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "Local teams support sourcing, due diligence, legal structuring, asset servicing and resolution across China, coordinated through ShoreVest’s institutional investment-management platform.",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "ShoreVest Asset Solutions is ShoreVest’s onshore asset-servicing and resolution platform, supporting local execution and credit recovery across China.",
          "source": "internal-preview/homepage-options/institutional-editorial/index.html"
